Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:02.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Got a ₹100 note? Flip it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.17,0:00:04.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's on the back was buried
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.63,0:00:05.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.29,0:00:07.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Rani ki Vav, in Patan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:09.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Built in the 11th century by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.29,0:00:10.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Queen Udayamati,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.12,0:00:11.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,in memory of her husband, King
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:12.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bhima I.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.57,0:00:14.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Designed like an upside-down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:15.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,temple:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:17.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,seven storeys down, sculptures
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:18.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,on every wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.35,0:00:21.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then the Saraswati flooded,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.05,0:00:22.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the whole stepwell vanished
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.01,0:00:23.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,under silt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.18,0:00:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,But that silt preserved it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:27.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Found again in the 1940s,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:29.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,a UNESCO World Heritage Site
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.41,0:00:30.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,since 2014.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.61,0:00:32.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next time you pay with ₹100,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.59,0:00:33.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,flip it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:35.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have you been to Rani ki Vav?
